WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.073 --> 00:00:02.791
- Oh my god.

00:00:02.791 --> 00:00:05.218
(happy music)

00:00:05.218 --> 00:00:05.902
(ice rattles)

00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:06.762
- Drink up, darling,

00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:09.792
I hate whiskey but
that's all that was left.

00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:10.379
(coughs)

00:00:10.379 --> 00:00:11.727
(laughing)

00:00:11.727 --> 00:00:12.307
- Hoo!

00:00:12.307 --> 00:00:13.292
- I keep trying to get
your mom's phone number.

00:00:13.292 --> 00:00:13.972
- Instead of my boyfriend's--

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:15.381
- But she won't give me
her mom's phone number!

00:00:16.071 --> 00:00:17.290
- I love dogs!

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.379
They're like the best thing in the world!

00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:20.192
- I love puppies.

00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:20.912
(squeals)

00:00:20.912 --> 00:00:21.631
- I never had a dog.

00:00:21.631 --> 00:00:23.313
My parents had dogs before they had me.

00:00:23.313 --> 00:00:24.347
The dogs were on purpose.

00:00:24.347 --> 00:00:25.412
I was a mistake.

00:00:25.412 --> 00:00:26.507
(laughing)

00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:30.202
(screaming)
(laughing)

00:00:30.202 --> 00:00:31.705
(laughing)

00:00:31.705 --> 00:00:32.611
(squeals)

00:00:32.611 --> 00:00:33.307
- Aaaah!

00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:35.792
- Oh, come here! Look at you!
- Oh my god!

00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:37.091
- Look at you!

00:00:37.091 --> 00:00:38.183
- You're so fluffy!

00:00:38.183 --> 00:00:39.646
- Are you for real?

00:00:39.646 --> 00:00:40.853
- I'm gonna cry!

00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:42.130
(laughing)

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.431
- Oh, it smells so good!

00:00:43.431 --> 00:00:44.661
- Wait, let's make them kiss.

00:00:44.661 --> 00:00:45.938
- I can't, I'm crying.

00:00:45.938 --> 00:00:47.355
- Do you wanna be by each other?

00:00:47.355 --> 00:00:48.725
Oh my god, they love each other.

00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:49.746
(gasps)

00:00:49.746 --> 00:00:50.605
There's more?

00:00:50.605 --> 00:00:52.315
(whimpers)

00:00:52.315 --> 00:00:53.981
- No! I'm crying!

00:00:53.981 --> 00:00:54.991
(cries)

00:00:54.991 --> 00:00:57.239
- I've had such a hard Friday.

00:00:57.239 --> 00:00:58.859
- Oh my god, I'm in tears.

00:00:58.859 --> 00:01:00.075
- The happiest day!

00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:00.981
- I can't take it.

00:01:00.981 --> 00:01:02.072
I just can't.

00:01:03.682 --> 00:01:05.254
- Don't give us more d--
- I want more!

00:01:05.254 --> 00:01:06.758
(gasps)
- No, they can't keep coming!

00:01:06.758 --> 00:01:08.918
(cries)

00:01:08.918 --> 00:01:10.682
- Where did you get these dogs?

00:01:10.682 --> 00:01:12.563
- Wait, is this really happening?

00:01:12.563 --> 00:01:14.815
Because I can't comprehend
what's happening.

00:01:14.815 --> 00:01:15.860
- There's too many dogs.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.277
- Oh my gah-ha!

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:18.414
- They're gonna fall off the table!

00:01:18.414 --> 00:01:20.179
- I'm like a single
mother in here, I can't.

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:21.433
I can't!

00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:23.700
- Aw, they give me so much hope!

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:24.823
(squeals)

00:01:24.823 --> 00:01:26.453
- This is crazy!

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:29.072
- Why would you get me
drunk and then give me dogs?

00:01:29.072 --> 00:01:31.089
- I shouldn't have drank whiskey!

00:01:31.089 --> 00:01:32.894
I can't protect them!

00:01:32.894 --> 00:01:34.791
- Why did God give us puppies?

00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:35.346
Come here.

00:01:35.346 --> 00:01:36.285
(whimpers)

00:01:36.285 --> 00:01:37.245
- He's on his belly!

00:01:37.245 --> 00:01:38.103
- Are they adoptable?

00:01:40.027 --> 00:01:41.606
(cries)

00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:43.371
- If you want a friend for life,

00:01:43.371 --> 00:01:44.625
then you should just get a dog.

00:01:44.625 --> 00:01:46.180
- They just need a home,

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.481
and you can give them one.

00:01:47.481 --> 00:01:49.659
- Like, look at this (bleep) dog.

00:01:49.659 --> 00:01:51.219
And look at this (bleep) dog.

00:01:51.219 --> 00:01:52.641
(laughs)

00:01:53.521 --> 00:01:54.725
- Did you see that?

00:01:54.725 --> 00:01:55.723
She just licked me.

00:01:55.723 --> 00:01:57.929
- I'm a puppy, I'm a puppy.

00:01:57.929 --> 00:02:01.412
- Okay, say 'cheese',
Pistachio! Say cheese!

00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:03.293
- I had bunnies bigger than this.

00:02:03.293 --> 00:02:04.454
My bunnies would eat you!

00:02:04.454 --> 00:02:05.174
But they're dead.

00:02:05.174 --> 00:02:06.242
- Remember when you guys just kept

00:02:06.242 --> 00:02:07.403
bringing dogs in here?

00:02:07.403 --> 00:02:09.191
That was so crazy...

00:02:11.207 --> 00:02:11.881
- Hi!

00:02:12.593 --> 00:02:13.684
- Oh, hey guys!

00:02:15.004 --> 00:02:16.959
- Sarah! Up here.

00:02:16.959 --> 00:02:18.060
- We made a series!

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.686
- It's coming out November 18.

00:02:19.686 --> 00:02:20.798
- Please watch it.

00:02:20.798 --> 00:02:22.586
- Get it here, over here.
- There.

00:02:22.586 --> 00:02:23.197
- Over there.

00:02:23.197 --> 00:02:23.620
- You got it.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:24.870
I think they got it, okay.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:25.510
- I'm out.
- Okay, bye!

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:26.159
- If you look in the area,

00:02:26.159 --> 00:02:26.960
then you could see it.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:30.396
It'll be released 2015. November.

00:02:30.396 --> 00:02:31.202
Okay.

